      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Talent Flow - Telegram Candidate Ingest Workflow\n\n### Work Distribution Architecture:\n1. **n8n (Visual Orchestrator)**: Listens to incoming group messages / files, filters non-resume traffic, and manages notifications.\n2. **FastAPI :8000 (AI & Database Core)**: Extracts text from DOCX/PDF/Images, runs Gemini 3.8 Flash analysis, deduplicates by phone number, and saves to Firestore.\n\n### Network Host Configuration:\n- If n8n runs inside **Docker (Windows/Mac)**: use `http://host.docker.internal:8000`\n- If n8n runs directly on **Host Node.js**: use `http://localhost:8000`\n\n### Telegram Privacy Mode Requirement:\nIn Telegram `@BotFather`, run `/setprivacy` -> Select Bot -> **Disable**.",
